{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54370","headline":"因览《宝林传》 · 僧润","name":"因览《宝林传》","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祖月禅风集《宝林》，二千余载道堪寻。\n虽分西国与东国，不隔人心到佛心。\n迦叶最初传去盛，慧能末後得来深。\n览期顿悟超凡衆，嗟彼常迷古与今。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧润","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}